{"availability":"available","full":"zhenglinpan/AnitaDataset","name":"AnitaDataset","description":"A free, licensed, and industrial animation dataset","category":"Design","language":null,"stars":93,"forks":6,"created":"2024-05-24T23:30:39Z","updated":"2024-06-26T07:54:04Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://zhenglinpan.github.io/AnitaDataset_homepage/","topics":["animation-dataset","cartoon","cartoon-dataset","dataset"],"demo":"https://zhenglinpan.github.io/AnitaDataset_homepage/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T05:49:22.396Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T05:49:22.396Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T05:49:22.396Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T05:49:22.396Z","stars":93,"forks":6}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["This is the official repository for Anita Dataset.","Anita Dataset is a collection of 16,000+ professional hand-drawn cartoon keyframes. The dataset contains 1080P sketch, color images and composition exported from engineering files of 14 different animations(more than 200 scenes in total), following the professional standards of the modern 2D animation industry.","Cartoon image sequence are provided in .png format, licensed by animators under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 and CC BY License. Here we show some examples of the dataset:"],"features":["Hand-drawn Authenticity: Unlike AnimeRun or PBC, which are rendered from 3D character models, Anita Dataset consists of frames drawn by human hands, aligning more closely with the standards of the modern 2D animation…","High-quality Intermediate Format: Compared to Sakuga-42M Dataset, which provides large-scale but 480p rendered clips, Anita Dataset offers high-resolution intermediate images. More than 16,000 sketches and flat colors…","Sketch-Color Alignment : Anita Dataset contains sketch-color pairs exported directly from engineering files."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/zhenglinpan/AnitaDataset/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"5e652ef45048439b56fca9